MonoBehaviour:
  m_ObjectHideFlags: 0
  m_CorrespondingSourceObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabInstance: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabAsset: {fileID: 0}
  m_GameObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_Enabled: 1
  m_EditorHideFlags: 0
  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: 2d6a7fd86913b514e82373a096f27bd2, type: 3}
  m_Name: Reginald
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: Assembly-CSharp::DialogueScripts.DialogueSO
  lines:
  - talksprite: {fileID: 555138236, guid: e20c3f49b746d944599024516c3cba87, type: 3}
    displayName: Reginald
    textDelay: 0
    text: Conius, you knew the policy. Employee bathroom breaks cannot be longer
      than 5 minutes. Why are you trying to get revenge for something which is so
      clearly your own fault.
  - talksprite: {fileID: 1990359765, guid: fac91376465621f47a071d9b4574ee7a, type: 3}
    displayName: Traffic Conius
    textDelay: 0
    text: 'I''m not doing this for revenge. The Mega Merger has to be stopped. '
  - talksprite: {fileID: -1512011415, guid: e20c3f49b746d944599024516c3cba87, type: 3}
    displayName: Reginald
    textDelay: 0
    text: How did you find out about that? That is top secret!
  - talksprite: {fileID: 555138236, guid: e20c3f49b746d944599024516c3cba87, type: 3}
    displayName: Reginald
    textDelay: 0
    text: Nevertheless, noone will ever be powerful enough to defeat Eve L Mart,
      even with all the hacks in the world.
  - talksprite: {fileID: 555138236, guid: e20c3f49b746d944599024516c3cba87, type: 3}
    displayName: 'Reginald: '
    textDelay: 0
    text: This conversation is a waste of my time. I need to go harass my employees
      before they get any funny ideas...
  - talksprite: {fileID: 555138236, guid: e20c3f49b746d944599024516c3cba87, type: 3}
    displayName: Reginald
    textDelay: 0
    text: Oh, hello there, valued customer! This area is off limits, why don't you
      go ahead and go back into the main area with me.
  - talksprite: {fileID: 1131555762, guid: b64c34112d8176541b6e3fa53969d57e, type: 3}
    displayName: Hack Wiz
    textDelay: 0
    text: "\U0001F621\U0001F621\U0001F621\U0001F92C\U0001F92C\U0001F92C\U0001F6A6\U0001F6A6"
  - talksprite: {fileID: 555138236, guid: e20c3f49b746d944599024516c3cba87, type: 3}
    displayName: 'Reginald: '
    textDelay: 0
    text: I recognize you now, that young wizard who's been keeping the Card Shop
      open. Get out now or prepare to experience the power of all our shareholders
      combinded.
  - talksprite: {fileID: 0}
    displayName: 'Hackwiz: '
    textDelay: 0
    text: " \U0001F914...\r\n"
  - talksprite: {fileID: 0}
    displayName: 'Hackwiz: '
    textDelay: 0
    text: "\u274C\U0001F44E"
  - talksprite: {fileID: 0}
    displayName: 'Hackwiz: '
    textDelay: 0
    text: 'THEN PREPARE TO FEEL THE WRATH OF REGINALD MANAGER!!! '
  startsBattle: 1
  hasExclamationMark: 0
  textColorDefault: {r: 0, g: 0, b: 0, a: 1}
  textBackgroundColorDefault: {r: 0.827451, g: 0.8352941, b: 0.5568628, a: 1}
